        <ul class="bronnen klein">
          <li>First Page Sage, <a href="https://firstpagesage.com/reports/google-click-through-rates-ctrs-by-ranking-position/" rel="noopener">Google Click-Through Rates by Ranking Position in 2026</a>: klikratio per positie, met en zonder AI-antwoord.</li>
          <li>Ahrefs, <a href="https://ahrefs.com/blog/search-traffic-study/" rel="noopener">96.55% of Content Gets No Traffic From Google</a>, december 2023.</li>
          <li>Google Search Central, <a href="https://developers.google.com/search/docs/fundamentals/how-search-works" rel="noopener">In-depth guide to how Google Search works</a>.</li>
          <li>Google Search Central, <a href="https://developers.google.com/search/docs/appearance/ai-features" rel="noopener">AI features and your website</a>.</li>
          <li>De marktprijzen komen van openbare prijspagina's van Nederlandse bureaus en aanbieders, bekeken in oktober 2026. Het gaat om instapprijzen van € 750 tot € 3.000 per maand en contracten van 3, 6 of 12 maanden.</li>
        </ul>
